{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>And Moses took of the oil of anointing.</b> Here it implies that after he offered up from the second ram — the fat and the tail and the membrane of the liver and the kidneys and the right thigh — he took of the oil of anointing and of the blood and sprinkled it upon Aaron and upon his sons. But in the section of Tetzaveh, regarding the command, we find it in reverse order."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:10:46.791505989Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}